                tags: [], explanation: `Distance from the origin is Pythagoras: d = √(x² + y²) = √(${p.x}² + ${p.y}²)${whole ? ` = ${d}` : ` = √${d2}`}. Adding |x| + |y| measures the staircase walk, not the straight line.`,
